---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Security Center | Yasui Game"
    description="Panduan keamanan akun game setelah pembelian."
>
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-24 pb-20">
        <header
            class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-12 border-b border-gray-800 pb-8"
        >
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <div class="i-lucide-shield-check text-cyan-400 text-2xl">
                    </div>
                    <span
                        class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-900/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded"
                    >
                        Official Guide
                    </span>
                </div>
                <h1
                    class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter uppercase relative inline-block"
                >
                    Security Center
                    <div
                        class="absolute -top-1 -right-2 w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full animate-pulse"
                    >
                    </div>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-gray-500 font-mono text-sm mt-2">
                    Proteksi aset digital Anda dengan standar keamanan
                    tertinggi.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-1">
                <button
                    type="button"
                    id="btn-id"
                    class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold transition-all duration-300 bg-cyan-500 text-black shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(6,182,212,0.5)] cursor-pointer"
                >
                    INDONESIA
                </button>
                <button
                    type="button"
                    id="btn-en"
                    class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
                >
                    ENGLISH
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="relative min-h-[400px]">
            <article
                id="content-id"
                class="prose prose-invert prose-cyan max-w-none animate-[fadeIn_0.5s_ease-out]"
            >
                <div
                    class="bg-gray-900/30 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl mb-8"
                >
                    <p
                        class="lead text-gray-300 font-mono text-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500 pl-4 italic"
                    >
                        "Akun yang baru dibeli adalah aset berharga. Kelalaian
                        dalam mengamankan akun dapat menyebabkan kehilangan
                        akses permanen."
                    </p>
                </div>

                <h3>1. Ganti Password Segera</h3>
                <p>
                    Langkah pertama setelah menerima data akun adalah mengganti <strong
                        >Password Email</strong
                    > dan <strong>Password Game</strong>. Jangan gunakan
                    password yang sama dengan akun sosial media Anda yang lain.
                    Gunakan kombinasi:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Huruf Besar & Kecil (A-z)</li>
                    <li>Angka (0-9)</li>
                    <li>Simbol Unik (!@#$)</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>2. Aktifkan 2FA (Two-Factor Authentication)</h3>
                <p>
                    Wajib mengaktifkan verifikasi 2 langkah pada email yang
                    terkait dengan akun game. Gunakan aplikasi seperti <strong
                        >Google Authenticator</strong
                    > atau <strong>Authy</strong> daripada SMS (karena SMS rentan
                    terhadap SIM Swap).
                </p>

                <h3>3. JANGAN Bagikan OTP</h3>
                <div
                    class="bg-red-900/10 border border-red-500/30 p-4 rounded-lg not-prose mb-6"
                >
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div
                            class="i-lucide-alert-triangle text-red-500 mt-1 shrink-0"
                        >
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4
                                class="text-red-400 font-bold uppercase text-sm mb-1"
                            >
                                Peringatan Keras
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">
                                Admin Yasui Game <strong>TIDAK PERNAH</strong> meminta
                                kode OTP Anda untuk alasan apapun. Jika ada yang meminta
                                OTP mengatasnamakan kami, itu adalah PENIPUAN.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3>4. Force Logout Device Lain</h3>
                <p>
                    Cek bagian "Device Management" atau "Kelola Perangkat" di
                    pengaturan akun game dan email. Pastikan untuk melakukan <strong
                        >Log Out All Devices</strong
                    > untuk menendang akses dari perangkat penjual sebelumnya.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article
                id="content-en"
                class="hidden prose prose-invert prose-cyan max-w-none animate-[fadeIn_0.5s_ease-out]"
            >
                <div
                    class="bg-gray-900/30 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl mb-8"
                >
                    <p
                        class="lead text-gray-300 font-mono text-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500 pl-4 italic"
                    >
                        "Your newly purchased account is a valuable asset.
                        Failure to secure it immediately may result in permanent
                        loss of access."
                    </p>
                </div>

                <h3>1. Change Passwords Immediately</h3>
                <p>
                    The very first step after receiving account credentials is
                    to change both the <strong>Email Password</strong> and the <strong
                        >Game Account Password</strong
                    >. Do not reuse passwords from your social media. Use a
                    strong combination of:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Uppercase & Lowercase Letters (A-z)</li>
                    <li>Numbers (0-9)</li>
                    <li>Unique Symbols (!@#$)</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>2. Enable 2FA (Two-Factor Authentication)</h3>
                <p>
                    It is mandatory to enable 2-step verification on the email
                    linked to the game account. We recommend using apps like <strong
                        >Google Authenticator</strong
                    > or <strong>Authy</strong> instead of SMS (as SMS is vulnerable
                    to SIM Swap attacks).
                </p>

                <h3>3. NEVER Share OTP</h3>
                <div
                    class="bg-red-900/10 border border-red-500/30 p-4 rounded-lg not-prose mb-6"
                >
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div
                            class="i-lucide-alert-triangle text-red-500 mt-1 shrink-0"
                        >
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4
                                class="text-red-400 font-bold uppercase text-sm mb-1"
                            >
                                Critical Warning
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">
                                Yasui Game Admins will <strong>NEVER</strong> ask
                                for your OTP code for any reason. If anyone asks for
                                OTP claiming to be us, it is a SCAM.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3>4. Force Logout Other Devices</h3>
                <p>
                    Check the "Device Management" section in the game and email
                    settings. Ensure you perform a <strong
                        >Log Out All Devices</strong
                    > to remove access from the previous owner's devices.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <section class="mt-16 border-t border-gray-800 pt-8">
            <div
                class="bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 to-black border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 relative overflow-hidden group"
            >
                <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-500/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-500"
                >
                </div>

                <div class="relative z-10">
                    <h3
                        class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2"
                        id="cta-title"
                    >
                        Masih Bingung?
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm max-w-md" id="cta-desc">
                        Hubungi Admin via WhatsApp untuk panduan keamanan
                        spesifik per game (Mobile Legends, Genshin Impact, dll).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <a
                    href="https://wa.me/6281234567890"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-full transition shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,197,94,0.4)]"
                >
                    <div class="i-lucide-message-circle"></div>
                    <span id="cta-btn">WhatsApp Admin</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script is:inline>
        const btnId = document.getElementById("btn-id");
        const btnEn = document.getElementById("btn-en");
        const contentId = document.getElementById("content-id");
        const contentEn = document.getElementById("content-en");
        const ctaTitle = document.getElementById("cta-title");
        const ctaDesc = document.getElementById("cta-desc");
        const ctaBtn = document.getElementById("cta-btn");

        function switchLang(lang) {
            if (lang === "id") {
                if (btnId) btnId.className = "px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold transition-all duration-300 bg-cyan-500 text-black shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(6,182,212,0.5)] cursor-pointer";
                if (btnEn) btnEn.className = "px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer";
                contentId?.classList.remove("hidden");
                contentEn?.classList.add("hidden");
                if (ctaTitle) ctaTitle.innerText = "Masih Bingung?";
                if (ctaDesc) ctaDesc.innerText = "Hubungi Admin via WhatsApp untuk panduan keamanan spesifik per game (Mobile Legends, Genshin Impact, dll).";
                if (ctaBtn) ctaBtn.innerText = "WhatsApp Admin";
            } else {
                if (btnEn) btnEn.className = "px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold transition-all duration-300 bg-cyan-500 text-black shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(6,182,212,0.5)] cursor-pointer";
                if (btnId) btnId.className = "px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer";
                contentEn?.classList.remove("hidden");
                contentId?.classList.add("hidden");
                if (ctaTitle) ctaTitle.innerText = "Need Help?";
                if (ctaDesc) ctaDesc.innerText = "Contact Admin via WhatsApp for game-specific security guides (Mobile Legends, Genshin Impact, etc).";
                if (ctaBtn) ctaBtn.innerText = "Contact Support";
            }
        }

        btnId?.addEventListener("click", () => switchLang("id"));
        btnEn?.addEventListener("click", () => switchLang("en"));
    </script>
</Layout>
